{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10132060","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10132060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1013206001:0":{"text":"어떡하죠, 어떻게 해야 하죠? 위험한 일이라도 생긴 거면 어떡해요?","source_cn":"怎么办，怎么办？她不会遇到什么危险吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB2822F33725483A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1013206002:1":{"text":"메린, 페이를 좀 찾아 주면 안 돼? 아... 내가 같이 있었어야 했는데.","source_cn":"梅瑞特，你能去找找她吗？唉……早知道我就陪着她了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B17748A81DCFA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1013206002":{"text":"메린, 페이를 좀 찾아 주면 안 돼? 아... 내가 같이 있었어야 했는데.","source_cn":"梅瑞特，你能去找找她吗？唉……早知道我就陪着她了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10B17748A81DCFA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1013206003:1":{"text":"이게 단서가 될지는 모르겠지만, 페이는 보석을 감지하는 부러운 능력이 있었어요...","source_cn":"非要说的话，菲对宝石有一定的感应能力，这还挺令人羡慕的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD6BFEB8608249FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1013206004:1":{"text":"학자 아가씨, 삼천포로 빠지지 말아요.","source_cn":"这位学者小姐，不要跑题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA866F0BED511C3AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_t